@@ -0,0 +1,168 @@
+# Copyright © 2025 Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd.
+# Based on vLLM: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm
+# Based on flash-linear-attention: https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention
